        "b7c1d2e3-0000-4000-8000-000000000001": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 544,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 192,
            "content": "## Test data assumption\n\n`missingText` in **Set Variables** is intentionally declared without a value so it resolves to `undefined` downstream. Do not fill it in - the flow tests that **Switch** and **Contains** handle a missing input (issue #1394).\n\nIf a component is routed to the wrong port, its Assert never fires and **After All** fails on timeout."
